For clarity, the offset I am talking about is the one in [`draw_list_draw_indirect`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_renderingdevice.html#class-renderingdevice-method-draw-list-draw-indirect)

Instead of a command buffer that holds 4 (or 5) floats, you will create one that holds 5xnum_surfaces floats, the layout is basically:
```
    uint32_t    vertexCount0;
    uint32_t    instanceCount0;
    uint32_t    firstVertex0;
    uint32_t    firstInstance0;
    uint32_t    vertexCount1;
    uint32_t    instanceCount1;
    uint32_t    firstVertex1;
    uint32_t    firstInstance1;
    uint32_t    vertexCount2;
    uint32_t    instanceCount2;
    uint32_t    firstVertex2;
    uint32_t    firstInstance2;
```

Then when drawing:
```
//surface 0
draw_list_draw_indirect(draw_list, false, command_buffer, 0, 1, 16);
//surface 1
draw_list_draw_indirect(draw_list, false, command_buffer, 16, 1, 16);
//surface 2
draw_list_draw_indirect(draw_list, false, command_buffer, 32, 1, 16);
```

